# Files excluded from `gcloud run jobs deploy --source .` uploads (the image needs only loaders/, dbt/, jobs/,
# pyproject.toml, README.md and the Dockerfile). Patterns are anchored with a leading slash where a bare name
# would also match a nested directory: `tests` alone excluded dbt/tests, dropping every singular dbt test
# from the image (found on the first job run, 2026-10-02).
.git
.gitignore
.venv
.superpowers
docs
/tests
dbt/target
dbt/dbt_packages
dbt/logs
